title: "SIREN (Superintelligence Real-time Early Notice)"
message: "If you use this index, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SIREN / DOOMCON contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/messagegabrielhere-lgtm/doomcon"
url: "https://messagegabrielhere-lgtm.github.io/doomcon/"
abstract: >-
  A real-time index of AI activity tempo computed from public data by open
  code. Five pillars, one 0–100 score, one level from DOOMCON 5 (DORMANT) to
  DOOMCON 1 (UNPRECEDENTED). Every number is recomputable; receipts are
  hash-chained.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - open data
  - osint
  - activity index
  - transparency
